il has made significant strides by approving the conversion of leasehold properties to freehold. Additionally, plans for high-mast lights installation at thirty-five city locations will enhance safety. To boost water supply, five high-yield tube wells are set for construction. The council also scrutinized sanitation arrangements, penalizing outsourcing agencies, and deliberated on ward-specific civic matters for prompt action.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/patna-civic-body-approves-four-proposals-leasehold-properties-in-six-areas-may-go-freehold/133255484?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-51764/133255484.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}]}